== Trivia ==
* During the first [[Jerry's Workshop]] event, the '''Baker''' stood in the same spot as Jerry did in the event area.<!--
* There was a glitch in SkyBlock Year 72, where the cakes were turned to year "0".
** While most of the glitched cakes were fixed, some still exist. These cakes, if found in your inventory, will be deleted within seconds.-->
*If the player opens the '''Baker'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s interface and the '''Baker''' leaves, the menu remains open and can still be interacted with.
*The '''Baker''' awards the most {{Copper}} of any [[The Garden#Visitors|Garden Visitor]] at {{Copper|550}}, or {{Copper|625}} with the Ladybug attribute.
*The third dialogue line of the Baker used to say "{{Rmt|&fI've recently added a &dNew Year Cake Bag &fto my inventory. Sadly, it's not free! Click me again to open my shop!}}"
